      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `83a7ae3678ae2d6d6ae7d5b53cc59db7c8dacc35d57d0d8d992a538ca371d262--2.-Victims-of-crime-states-and-territories-Tables-9-to-16-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2020\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | b5ff65d22e61adabd696091d6fbcf1b6c890acb7d19002345c0f0ff06e79ca0f | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | 60650b202bc23ee767181007c35b383894e829db2128338dc0a9198d472b38f4 | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | be741d68bae7469078dc8f8ebc0ea45229ed2cfb1926b17b91a282bcd086163b | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | 9593c8834179584b041fffef8e9b1c991684948a174cc1cf3e06305aec5e537a | missing |\n| \"Table 12\" | 9a70334a4802b3a540fa85b699f51cf51dc04551a3b9fbbac9abdb81ffea86bb | missing |\n| \"Table 13\" | 507e9f913271a32d0e36f9f5cdd8cb32d04c016509398cf4a0c66ffebcc84bda | missing |\n| \"Table 14\" | 878b5ea3986bf3577d7051bbb3b726248084d1801995401e554f1475aada39ee | missing |\n| \"Table 15\" | c585a05bb5b1e5e3f3c1d5b40925685386d4ecc0480b8d891f7838f31d8ba9d8 | missing |\n| \"Table 16\" | 324042ff10766bfb38fbd0554899b46e7cc77aac486fefd5ffc51680d1899174 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
